<title>USA: Everest Medical introduces new forceps.</title>
<headline>Everest Medical introduces new forceps.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Everest Medical Corp said it introduced a 3mm Bipolar BiCOAG Forceps last week at industry meeting in Chicago.</p>
<p>President John Shannon said this represents the company's first entry into the emerging market of micro-laparoscopy and office-based laparoscopy, a method of examining the abdominal cavity using a viewing tube.</p>
<p>He said the company also will introduce a 15cm version of its 10mm Bipolar BiCOAT Cutting Forceps.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
</text>
